Тогда-вид day_probes day, HardwareTraced, the frame of day_rt: editor.log, the last "[RadianceCache] traced T of budget B ... stamped N" line before this capture - N greater than in the day_ss line (the refraction path ends request their cells and the cache marks them, 3G D3); T not above B
